00:03:10.341 --> 00:03:11.591
And that's why.

00:03:12.758 --> 00:03:14.378
It's a big challenge.

00:03:14.378 --> 00:03:17.913
Not just for me but I
am always in my teams,

00:03:17.913 --> 00:03:19.933
I was able to boss the players

00:03:19.933 --> 00:03:20.932
and it is going to happen here as well.

00:03:20.932 --> 00:03:24.740
When that happens everything will be easy.

00:03:24.740 --> 00:03:28.524
- You've said you are
obsessive about build-up play.

00:03:28.524 --> 00:03:32.691
