you sacrifice that at all?

00:03:33.713 --> 00:03:35.223
- Impossible.

00:03:35.223 --> 00:03:36.556
It's impossible.

00:03:37.393 --> 00:03:39.981
Sacrifice for what, so you lose the game?

00:03:39.981 --> 00:03:42.719
If you believe in that,
you have to keep going.

00:03:42.719 --> 00:03:46.226
So, when it's going to happen,
when to use the goal keeper,

00:03:46.226 --> 00:03:47.739
you're going to wrong pass

00:03:47.739 --> 00:03:50.026
and you're going to receive a goal

00:03:50.026 --> 00:03:51.977
and the people say why
you doesn't hit ball,

00:03:51.977 --> 00:03:54.299
no you have to insist on that

00:03:54.299 --> 00:03:57.036
there is a why, why you miss that pass.

00:03:57.036 --> 00:03:59.035
- So you wouldn't, what we call win ugly?

00:03:59.035 --> 00:04:02.286
Play maybe not attractive if
you're going to get a win.

00:04:02.286 --> 00:04:03.900
- No no no no, I will win.

00:04:03.900 --> 00:04:07.487
The people say no is it
when you play the build-up

00:04:07.487 --> 00:04:08.765
or you know, I want to win.

00:04:08.765 --> 00:04:09.821
I want to play serious.

00:04:09.821 --> 00:04:11.574
I want to be effective.

00:04:11.574 --> 00:04:16.190
I don't do that to be I want
to play build-up, no no.

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:18.029
I make a build-up to convince the players

00:04:18.029 --> 00:04:21.915
that this is a consequence
of positives and negatives.

00:04:21.915 --> 00:04:24.926
If I believed and do that
and it is not productive

00:04:24.926 --> 00:04:27.759
for the team, I would not do that.

00:04:29.972 --> 00:04:31.857
But I was a football player and manager

00:04:31.857 --> 00:04:34.608
and always when I do that I
would score a lot of goals

00:04:34.608 --> 00:04:38.054
and concede few and that's
why I believe in that.

00:04:38.054 --> 00:04:39.877
- So it's attractive but with purpose.

00:04:39.877 --> 00:04:42.759
- Of course, I want to win because

00:04:42.759 --> 00:04:45.797
if not City's going to fire me.

00:04:45.797 --> 00:04:47.333
- [Interviewer] If you
were to win the trophy

00:04:47.333 --> 00:04:48.854
again at Wembley, would you feel

00:04:48.854 --> 00:04:50.619
you would have come full circle?

00:04:50.619 --> 00:04:54.437
- Yeah, but never thought
to play in Barcelona

00:04:54.437 --> 00:04:57.631
when I was a boy, never thought
to win Champions League,

00:04:57.631 --> 00:04:59.811
never thought to become a coach,

00:04:59.811 --> 00:05:02.478
but before to win a championship

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:08.587
and now to try to beat one of
the best teams of the world

00:05:09.783 --> 00:05:12.243
in this atmosphere in Wembley,

00:05:12.243 --> 00:05:14.593
for us it's a dream come true.

00:05:14.593 --> 00:05:17.728
- You say that or we read
that you say that you

00:05:17.728 --> 00:05:19.742
only really stay anywhere
for three or four years.

00:05:19.742 --> 00:05:22.325
Do you intend to build a legacy

00:05:25.216 --> 00:05:27.314
or at least put the foundations...

00:05:27.314 --> 00:05:29.117
- No, I came to learn.

00:05:29.117 --> 00:05:30.592
- You've come to learn?

00:05:30.592 --> 00:05:32.188
- Yeah, of course, that's why I move on.

00:05:32.188 --> 00:05:33.292
I came to learn.

00:05:33.292 --> 00:05:34.794
You know there will be still in Barcelona.

00:05:34.794 --> 00:05:37.662
- What is the biggest
challenge you face now?

00:05:37.662 --> 00:05:40.002
What is at the top of your to-do list?

00:05:40.002 --> 00:05:41.106
- Play good.

00:05:41.106 --> 00:05:42.773
- [Woman] Play good?

00:05:43.892 --> 00:05:45.346
- And after try to win one game

00:05:45.346 --> 00:05:47.282
and after second one and after another one

00:05:47.282 --> 00:05:52.123
but the first target is
team spirit and play good

00:05:52.123 --> 00:05:55.774
as much as possible and
after, try to win one game,

00:05:55.774 --> 00:05:58.514
and after the second one.

00:05:58.514 --> 00:06:00.894
- Three years from now
when you threaten to leave

00:06:00.894 --> 00:06:02.402
and we have to tie you to a chair,

00:06:02.402 --> 00:06:05.665
