what does success look
like three years from now

00:06:10.251 --> 00:06:11.665
for Manchester City?

00:06:11.665 --> 00:06:15.232
- Yeah, you know for the
people, for the media,

00:06:15.232 --> 00:06:16.609
how many titles are you going to win?

00:06:16.609 --> 00:06:19.468
Okay, you have success or not success.

00:06:19.468 --> 00:06:21.001
That is pretty sure.

00:06:21.001 --> 00:06:25.855
So, but at the end the title
is amazing, you lift the title

00:06:25.855 --> 00:06:28.398
and two days after the
people say what's next?

00:06:28.398 --> 00:06:32.554
I think the process is how
I will be comfortable here

00:06:32.554 --> 00:06:33.901
working with these guys.

00:06:33.901 --> 00:06:35.429
At the end my life, it depends on that.

00:06:35.429 --> 00:06:37.198
I will be happy when my
relationship with them

00:06:37.198 --> 00:06:39.404
and when we decide to play in that way,

00:06:39.404 --> 00:06:40.600
it works or it doesn't works

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:42.267
and that is the end.

00:06:43.281 --> 00:06:46.193
And I am pretty sure
the club will fantastic

00:06:46.193 --> 00:06:49.584
and the people working
with are going to help me.

00:06:49.584 --> 00:06:52.047
I'm pretty sure that's going to happen.

00:06:52.047 --> 00:06:53.824
It happened in Barcelona,
happened in Bayern Munich,

00:06:53.824 --> 00:06:55.263
and it's going to happen here.

00:06:55.263 --> 00:06:58.211
And of course, they're
going to fight everyday

00:06:58.211 --> 00:07:01.089
