we finish the game so,

00:07:04.528 --> 00:07:06.117
'Oh, 90 minutes, it was not bad.

00:07:06.117 --> 00:07:08.417
'I would have preferred to
be here and not in the bar.'

00:07:08.417 --> 00:07:10.363
That is a good sign, you know.

00:07:10.363 --> 00:07:12.594
And after the relationship
with the people.

00:07:12.594 --> 00:07:15.035
I think maybe because I am a Latin guy,

00:07:15.035 --> 00:07:19.035
I need to be close to the
guys to have to say...

00:07:20.579 --> 00:07:24.746
I'm going to kill you and five
minutes to love each other.

00:07:26.818 --> 00:07:29.776
I think I need that to be happy.

00:07:29.776 --> 00:07:33.553
And I hope in three years
that is going to happen.

00:07:33.553 --> 00:07:35.999
