00:07:53.368 --> 00:07:56.181
'Remember, you know
that with me as a coach

00:07:56.181 --> 00:07:58.370
'you will win everything.'

00:07:58.370 --> 00:07:59.810
And it happened.

00:07:59.810 --> 00:08:02.560
